{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957830/extras/SoftCoreDisclaimer.png?t=1730863099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957830/extras/Gif_Maintain.gif?t=1730863099\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Fine Body Needs Fine-Tuning!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After the relentless and violent battles with Tentamon, Kajun-chan needs some maintenance. Dive into the role of an engineer and help perfect her body's mechanisms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957830/extras/Gif_bathing.gif?t=1730863099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udebf Wash &amp; Scrub Off All the Dirt!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join in on the fun of Kajun-chan's bath time, but be prepared to do the scrubbing! The better your scrubbing skills, the more of Kajun you'll get to wash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957830/extras/Gif_clothes.gif?t=1730863099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Customize Kajun-chan costumes!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select from a wide range of Kajun-chan 's costume from her unlockable wardrobe! or just in the mood of wear nothing at all !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udca5And More to Come in Future Updates!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf1fEarn G-points to Unlock Rewards!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Redeem the G-points earned from mini-games to access your rewards! Explore different areas where you can enjoy your winnings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udf81 Model Viewer!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock and deploy holograms of both your enemies and characters from Shred &amp; Tear for a closer and dynamic look!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udf81 Music Box!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Taste the intense blend of blood and metal in the adrenaline-fueled beats of Shred &amp; Tear, a collection of songs uniquely composed for Kajun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udf81 Reward Picture Shelf!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the diverse Shred &amp; Tear Omake Comic series, where you'll discover insights into the game's lore, enjoy fascinating tidbits, and access exclusive illustrations and wallpapers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udf81 New Photo Mode!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhancing the photo mode from the prototype demo, you can now set Kajun in various animated poses. Expect more options for clothing and animations in future updates!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2957830?t=1730863099","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957830/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1730863099","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957830/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1730863099","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957830/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1730863099","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"-Changing costumes of Kajun-chan can have option to unlock nude skins outfit and sexy dance animations.\r\n-Some mini game might depict mint sexual abuse actions like in Maintenance game there will be cables going into Kajun-chan private body part ( of course it's her choice).\r\n* The game does not contain BDSM, Sexual assault/non-consensual sex, drug/alcohol abse, self-harm or suicide."},"demos":[{"appid":3058170,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957830/extras/SoftCoreDisclaimer.png?t=1730863099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957830/extras/Gif_Maintain.gif?t=1730863099\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Fine Body Needs Fine-Tuning!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After the relentless and violent battles with Tentamon, Kajun-chan needs some maintenance. Dive into the role of an engineer and help perfect her body's mechanisms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957830/extras/Gif_bathing.gif?t=1730863099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udebf Wash &amp; Scrub Off All the Dirt!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join in on the fun of Kajun-chan's bath time, but be prepared to do the scrubbing! The better your scrubbing skills, the more of Kajun you'll get to wash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957830/extras/Gif_clothes.gif?t=1730863099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Customize Kajun-chan costumes!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select from a wide range of Kajun-chan 's costume from her unlockable wardrobe! or just in the mood of wear nothing at all !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udca5And More to Come in Future Updates!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf1fEarn G-points to Unlock Rewards!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Redeem the G-points earned from mini-games to access your rewards! Explore different areas where you can enjoy your winnings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udf81 Model Viewer!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock and deploy holograms of both your enemies and characters from Shred &amp; Tear for a closer and dynamic look!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udf81 Music Box!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Taste the intense blend of blood and metal in the adrenaline-fueled beats of Shred &amp; Tear, a collection of songs uniquely composed for Kajun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udf81 Reward Picture Shelf!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the diverse Shred &amp; Tear Omake Comic series, where you'll discover insights into the game's lore, enjoy fascinating tidbits, and access exclusive illustrations and wallpapers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udf81 New Photo Mode!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhancing the photo mode from the prototype demo, you can now set Kajun in various animated poses. Expect more options for clothing and animations in future updates!</p>","developers":["Dzung Phung Dinh","Lucid Realm Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957830/header.jpg?t=1730863099","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257032212,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257032212/movie480.mp4?t=1719640878","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/s